PTX MP+rel.cta+acq.cta
"Same test, but cta scope while the threads are in different CTAs: not morally strong, stale data is allowed."
{
x=0;
y=0;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,gpu 0         | P1@cta 1,gpu 0         ;
 st.weak x, 1           | ld.acquire.cta r0, y   ;
 st.release.cta y, 1    | ld.weak r1, x          ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
